    <p>You must activate your Doane Gmail account before you can access your email.</p>
    <p><a href="#">Activate My Doane Gmail Account</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 30px;">
    <p>Login: <span data-field="login_format">{{ login_format }}</span></p>
    <p>Password: <span data-field="password_hint">{{ password_hint }}</span></p>
    <p>Doane Username (firstname.lastname): <span data-field="username_example">{{ username_example }}</span></p>
    <p>Password: <input type="text" placeholder="********"></p>
    <button class="button">Activate My Account</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 30px;">
    <p>This form will activate your Doane College Gmail account. You must activate your Doane Gmail account. You must activate your Doane Gmail account. After you activate your account, your Doane Gmail username and password will be the same as your Doane network login.</p>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Doane Username (firstname.lastname):</label>
      <input type="text" value="{{ username_example }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Password:</label>
      <input type="password" placeholder="********">
    </div>
    <button class="button">Activate My Account</button>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Your Doane College Google Apps account has been successfully activated. Please go <a href="#">here</a> and login. This will finish your activation.</p>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Doane Username (firstname.lastname):</label>
      <input type="text" value="{{ username_example }}">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
    <p>Sign in to your account at <span data-field="domain_name">{{ domain_name }}</span></p>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Username:</label>
      <input type="text" value="{{ username_example }}@{{ domain_name }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Password:</label>
      <input type="password" placeholder="********">
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="stay_signed" name="stay_signed">
      <label for="stay_signed">Stay signed in</label>
    </div>
    <button class="button">Sign in</button>
    <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><a href="#">Can't access your account?</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

